Key implementation details:
- Strict duplicate-key-rejecting loader:
```python
class StrictLoader(yaml.SafeLoader):
    pass
def _construct_mapping(loader, node, deep=False):
    if not isinstance(node, yaml.MappingNode): raise ...
    seen=set()
    for k_node,_ in node.value:
        k=loader.construct_object(k_node, deep=deep)
        if k in seen: raise ValueError(f"duplicate key {k!r} at line {k_node.start_mark.line+1}")
        seen.add(k)
    return yaml.SafeLoader.construct_mapping(loader, node, deep=deep)
StrictLoader.add_constructor(yaml.resolver.BaseResolver.DEFAULT_MAPPING_TAG, _construct_mapping)
```
Careful: overridden constructor must return mapping; with `deep` handling. Fine.

